**/*.damaged-*.json
# Each person's own mailbox for emailing students (the password encrypted) and its key: private, kept with the data only.
**/user-mail.json
**/mail-key
# Exchange rates kept for costs typed in dollars or pounds (refreshed hourly).
**/exchange-rates.json
# When each person last read each task (the red dots).
**/task-seen.json
# Each person's own email signature picture.
**/user-signatures/

# The university pages' pictures, fetched by the server and kept with the data (media-cache.js): a cache, never in git.
**/media-cache/
# More files the server writes into the data folder (found by the review of 21 Nov 2026): the private key for phone
