**/mock-bookings.json
**/mock-guidelines.json
**/guideline-files/
**/users.json
**/sessions.json
**/session-secret

# Copies of the data made before a new version starts (version-guard.js), and the note of which data folder is in use.
**/version-backups/
**/version-stamp.json
**/.data-folder
# The recent revisions kept when the server stops (server.js), so a page a few saves behind still saves after a restart.
**/recent-revisions.json.gz
